Exit the Redis terminal: exit

docker compose exec -it sql-db psql -U postgres -d employeedb


List all tables: \dt (You should see the employees table).
Query the table records: SELECT * FROM employees; (You should see the 3 seeded rows).
Exit the database terminal: \q


